# FFmpeg 8.1's libraries come from Debian (2026-10-02). deb-multimedia moved to FFmpeg 9
# (libavcodec63 and family) and no longer carries its 8.1 builds, but those builds stay
# installed with epoch 10 and shadow Debian's epoch-7 ones, so Debian's programs built
# against 8.1 (Blender among them) could not install: Debian's libavdevice62 needs its own
# libavformat62 and libavutil60 exactly. deb-multimedia's programs use FFmpeg 9 and are
# untouched. Revisit when Debian moves to FFmpeg 9.
Package: libavcodec62 libavcodec-extra62 libavformat62 libavformat-extra62 libavutil60 libavdevice62 libavfilter11 libavfilter-extra11 libswresample6 libswscale9
Pin: release o=Debian
Pin-Priority: 1001
